/* Detailed settings help */
"Pocket uses Bluetooth to pair, then the camera's own Wi-Fi for HEVC. USB-C, hotspot, and HDMI capture are not in this build." = "Pocket 先通过蓝牙（BLE）完成配对，再通过相机自身的 Wi-Fi 传输 HEVC 监看视频。当前版本暂不支持 USB-C、有线采集或 HDMI 采集。";
"The Pocket sends HEVC over the camera access point. Stream quality presets are not on this body." = "Pocket 通过相机热点传输 HEVC 视频；该机型不提供串流画质预设。";
"A second-screen watcher relay is not in this build. One phone talks to one Pocket." = "当前版本暂不支持将画面转发到第二块屏幕；一部手机只能连接一台 Pocket。";
"Opens the monitor with an eye on each element you can show or hide." = "打开监看画面编辑模式；带眼睛图标的项目都可以单独显示或隐藏。";
"Sign in to upload clips from the share popup. Frame.io needs the internet, so the phone hops off the camera Wi‑Fi for the upload." = "登录后可从分享窗口将素材上传到 Frame.io。上传需要互联网，手机会暂时离开相机 Wi-Fi，完成后再重新连接相机。";
"When sharing is available, this will trade glass-to-glass delay for a steadier stream. Not in this build." = "画面共享功能开放后，此选项可在更低延迟与更稳定的画面之间取舍；当前版本尚未启用。";
"When sharing is available, watchers would enter this code once. Not in this build." = "画面共享功能开放后，观看者首次连接时需要输入此密码；当前版本尚未启用。";
"When sharing is available, this would let a watcher ask to drive the camera. Not in this build." = "画面共享功能开放后，观看者可以申请控制相机；当前版本尚未启用。";
"Ask before starting or stopping recording to prevent mistaps." = "开始或停止录制前要求再次确认，避免拍摄时误触。";
"Short confirmation pulses for switches, settings, and gimbal limits. A connected controller also rumbles at a stop." = "切换设置或云台到达限位时提供短促振动反馈；连接的游戏手柄也会在云台停止时振动。";
"Experimental. Calibrate Head Lock (centered above the bottom bars) is shared forward: that AirPods pose and that gimbal pose are zero. A 53° head turn pans the Pocket 53°. Nod is tilt. Roll is shown only — the Pocket stick has no roll axis. Needs AirPods with motion (Pro, 3, Max, or later) in your ears. Off by default. STOP clears the lock. On-screen stick and a game controller win while you hold them." = "实验性功能。佩戴支持运动感应的 AirPods（Pro、第三代、Max 或更新型号），点击“校准头部锁定”后，当前头部姿态和云台姿态会被设为零点。左右转头控制云台水平旋转，点头或抬头控制俯仰；横滚角只显示，不控制云台。默认关闭，点击“停止”会清除校准。操作屏幕摇杆或游戏手柄时，手动控制会暂时优先。";
"How far a stick throw moves the gimbal — on-screen and a connected game controller. Small throws crawl; full throw is fastest. 4 is the captured feel. 5 reaches full speed sooner; 1 is the slowest." = "调整屏幕摇杆和外接手柄控制云台时的响应速度。数值越大，轻推摇杆也能更快转动；1 最慢，4 接近原相机手感，5 最灵敏。";
"A connected game controller. Left stick pans and tilts. Cross/A records. Circle/B recenters. Square/X is rotate-180. Triangle/Y tracks a face. L1/R1 jump zoom out/in. L2/R2 hold-to-zoom (deeper is faster). D-pad up/down ISO, left/right shutter. Unplug rests the stick. On-screen stick wins while you hold it." = "连接游戏手柄后：左摇杆控制云台水平和俯仰；×/A 开始或停止录制；○/B 回中；□/X 旋转 180°；△/Y 启用人脸追踪；L1/R1 分级缩放；按住 L2/R2 连续缩放，按得越深速度越快；方向键上下调 ISO、左右调快门。手柄断开时云台会立即停止；拖动屏幕摇杆时以屏幕操作为准。";
"Prevents auto-lock while OpenPocketCine is open. A monitor should stay lit. iOS may still dim when the device overheats." = "使用 OpenPocketCine 时阻止自动锁屏，方便持续监看；设备温度过高时，iOS 仍可能自动降低屏幕亮度。";
"Charcoal field-monitor chrome with Sky Blue accents, tuned for low reflection on set." = "深灰色现场监视器界面，配合天蓝色强调色，减少拍摄环境中的屏幕反光干扰。";
"Connection, live view, controls, and troubleshooting." = "查看相机连接、实时监看、控制方式和常见故障排查说明。";
"Opens a public issue form on GitHub for this project." = "打开本项目的 GitHub 公共问题反馈页面；请勿提交相机密码或其他隐私信息。";
"Start an idea in this project's feature-request discussion." = "前往项目的功能建议讨论区，提交新功能想法。";
"View the OpenPocketCine project on GitHub. Opening this may leave the camera Wi-Fi if that is the only network." = "在 GitHub 查看 OpenPocketCine 源代码。如果手机当前只连接了相机 Wi-Fi，打开网页可能需要先切换到互联网。";
"How healthy the camera link is right now — delivery, not radio RSSI." = "显示当前相机链路的实际传输质量，而不是单纯的无线信号强度（RSSI）。";
"Removes downloaded clip files from this phone. The clip list stays so you can cache them again from the camera." = "删除已经下载到手机的素材文件，但保留素材列表；重新连接相机后可以再次缓存。";
"Download the original camera file when you open a clip. Off keeps only the 720p proxy to save space. Share needs the original — connect the camera if it is not cached." = "打开素材时同时下载相机中的原始文件。关闭后只保留 720p 代理文件以节省空间；分享或导出需要原始文件，未缓存时请先连接相机。";
"Saves a report with connection events, warnings, and crashes. No name, location, or Wi-Fi password. Take a screenshot for TestFlight and paste the copied text into the feedback." = "生成包含连接事件、警告和崩溃信息的诊断报告，不包含姓名、位置或 Wi-Fi 密码。通过 TestFlight 反馈时，请附上截图并粘贴复制的诊断文字。";
"How the live-view frame is enlarged to fill the panel. The camera sends far fewer pixels than the panel has, so something always does this. Off is a plain sample, Fast is a fixed sharpening kernel, and Quality is the OS spatial upscaler.\n\nAI is different in kind: it is a machine-learning model that INFERS detail the camera never captured. It gives the sharpest-looking picture, but the fine texture it adds is invented — plausible rather than real — so it can suggest crispness the lens did not record. Judge critical focus on Quality or Fast, and treat AI as a viewing aid rather than evidence.\n\nOnly the options this device supports are shown." = "选择实时监看画面放大到屏幕尺寸时使用的算法。相机传来的监看分辨率低于手机屏幕，因此始终需要进行放大处理：“关闭”使用普通双线性采样；“快速”使用固定锐化算法；“高质量”使用系统级空间放大。\n\n“AI 增强”会通过机器学习推测相机未实际记录的细节，画面看起来最清晰，但新增纹理并不等于镜头真实解析到的内容。判断关键对焦时建议使用“高质量”或“快速”，AI 仅作为监看辅助。\n\n页面只会显示当前设备支持的选项。";

/* Settings field descriptions */
"Where the BLE → Wi-Fi → datalink handshake is right now." = "显示当前连接进行到哪一步：蓝牙配对、加入相机 Wi-Fi，或建立相机数据链路。";
"SSID joined for this session. The password stays in the iOS Keychain on this phone." = "本次连接使用的相机 Wi-Fi 名称（SSID）。密码只保存在本机的 iOS 钥匙串中。";
"Pair from the home list. Settings does not start a new pair — that stays on Your cameras." = "请从首页的“我的相机”列表开始配对；设置页不会启动新的相机配对。";
